OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPeriods of
OL,6,Fheavy rain arriving in Northern
OL,7,FIreland and western Scotland this
OL,8,Fevening. Persistent heavy rain
OL,9,Fdeveloping in northwest England and
OL,10,Fsouthwest Scotland by the morning and
OL,11,Fturning windier. Skies remaining
OL,12,Fclearer further southeast and becoming
OL,13,Fchilly with patchy fog.
OL,14,
OL,15,CFriday:FSpells of wet and windy
OL,16,Fweather across Scotland and Northern
OL,17,FIreland with some particularly heavy
OL,18,Frain developing across southwest
OL,19,FScotland and Cumbria later. Rather
OL,20,Fwarm with sunny spells elsewhere.
